{
  "abstract": "We have measured the cross section for p+p\u2192p+X for MX2 up to a constant fraction of s. We observe no rise for 130<E<400 GeV. The inelastic cross section for 0<M2<0.06s is 2.50\u00b10.05 mb for various values of s from 263 to 752 GeV2.",
